      "text": "Argentina and Brazil in 11 Days: Buenos Aires, El Calafate, Iguazú and Praia da Pipa"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "05bea40c5856f800fa859d8ffa6e88acdbc67a79ff7d93d6b30228a5a93e5f10",
