        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-amanda-mw6juwms-in2zy2i",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Visit two very different South American countries in one trip. Start in Buenos Aires, known for its European architecture, historic neighbourhoods and tango. Then explore Patagonia’s glacial landscapes and the Perito Moreno Glacier, see Iguazú Falls from both the Argentine and Brazilian sides, and spend a few days by the ocean in Praia da Pipa."
